title: "RADIHALT Product Identity and Technical Specification Dataset"
type: dataset
version: "2026-09-22"
date-released: 2026-09-22
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22910494"
authors:
  - name: "RADIHALT Research"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://radihalt.com/product#technical-specification-dataset"
abstract: >-
  RADIHALT Research publishes this open, versioned reference for the four
  current RADIHALT Faraday / EMF shielding blanket and mat variants. It links
  each size and color to its traceability identifiers, declared construction,
  current supplier-confirmed material and care specification, origin, and
  product URL.
keywords:
  - RADIHALT
  - Faraday fabric
  - electromagnetic shielding
  - product identifiers
  - GTIN
  - product specifications
